{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":275204,\"title\":\"Haltet die Welt an\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Katja Winzer lives with her eight-year-old son Tobias and her partner Jürgen in a small town near Bremerhaven. When Tobias does not come home one evening after playing games, and broadcasts remain fruitless throughout the circle of friends, Katja turns on the police. For Katja begins a nightmare of waiting, hope and fear, where she threatens to break. Only weeks later, the terrible idea that Tobias could have become a victim of a violent crime, to the certainty.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iwBQazpJdWG4yluoUqNtMqzwgVG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2010,\"runtime\":90,\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"DE\",\"name\":\"Germany\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Hartmut Griesmayr\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":221273,\"name\":\"Hartmut Griesmayr\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":49269,\"name\":\"Christine Neubauer\",\"character\":\"Katja Winzer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jk8UUqjCmfda7wsbJw50YM0Vfd9.jpg\"},{\"id\":44366,\"name\":\"Filip Peeters\",\"character\":\"Roman Maartens\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2QBAr0F5D9xi8jP6EXs4gS2CmSr.jpg\"},{\"id\":17405,\"name\":\"Martin Feifel\",\"character\":\"Jürgen Behrendt\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pqJIPUoL1rPAjBHJtXGNPfiyDtW.jpg\"},{\"id\":588136,\"name\":\"Andrea Lüdke\",\"character\":\"Silke Maartens\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/56LM3HTR6to7BAUv4PLL98o20BE.jpg\"},{\"id\":1244346,\"name\":\"Katharina Abt\",\"character\":\"Antje Langer\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4620,\"name\":\"Thorsten Merten\",\"character\":\"André Spanuth\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4BC0mf9zU8R73O9nDGoaYQqljGX.jpg\"},{\"id\":22664,\"name\":\"Jürgen Heinrich\",\"character\":\"Bernd Kückeberg\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gJg08xPBNMjqtx6da4RVYVnEgUd.jpg\"},{\"id\":2760524,\"name\":\"Finn Luca Jedamzick\",\"character\":\"Tim Maartens\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1363966,\"name\":\"Ludwig Skuras\",\"character\":\"Tobias Winzer\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":49089,\"name\":\"Senta Sommerfeld\",\"character\":\"Frau Kalkreuth\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2210599,\"name\":\"Franziska Mencz\",\"character\":\"Susanne Spanuth\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":7817,\"name\":\"Antoine Monot Jr.\",\"character\":\"Markus Lohmann\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/364fZaw3qEafw6cYHdwXqmkMWsW.jpg\"},{\"id\":1632340,\"name\":\"Julia Helbich\",\"character\":\"young Mother\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dtHbOJvV75X7w01HxmFoUXcDObq.jpg\"},{\"id\":1826203,\"name\":\"Oliver Warsitz\",\"character\":\"Journalist\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nWx2LEgiNY5SE66pp6RZ4PjuLT7.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":11423,\"title\":\"Memories of Murder\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jcgUjx1QcupGzjntTVlnQ15lHqy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6Kn6qW3an3DkPl3MahWemTzrjCt.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A sadistic serial rapist and murderer of young women terrorizes a small province in 1980s South Korea. To prevent further crimes, three increasingly desperate detectives with conflicting methods race against time to unravel the violent mind of the killer in a futile effort to solve the case.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4771,\"title\":\"Gone Baby Gone\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w98tAPUjNPxGAMCipNDWDt8PJo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r9qIuaPPJQuuNvGQGKHjmDxntsK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When 4 year old Amanda McCready disappears from her home and the police make little headway in solving the case, the girl's aunt, Beatrice McCready hires two private detectives, Patrick Kenzie and Angie Gennaro. The detectives freely admit that they have little experience with this type of case, but the family wants them for two reasons—they're not cops and they know the tough neighborhood in which they all live.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1266,\"title\":\"Street Kings\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iTO7sBfVTr7LUqiFtGeFW7g2Ncf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tNUM567Hrv925Z3vWXdJUjQE6Ho.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Tom Ludlow is a disillusioned L.A. Police Officer, rarely playing by the rules and haunted by the death of his wife. When evidence implicates him in the execution of a fellow officer, he is forced to go up against the cop culture he's been a part of his entire career, ultimately leading him to question the loyalties of everyone around him.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":57361,\"title\":\"The Yellow Sea\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yPJMDxam5HP0DAc1rMk0aNRpSc5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lnxXvGylX41RRTuSXIEM7P0eBYu.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A Korean man in China takes an assassination job in South Korea to make money and find his missing wife. But when the job is botched, he is forced to go on the run from the police and the gangsters who paid him.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":26390,\"title\":\"Brooklyn's Finest\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9ZyJJpMsc3bF8gduDaxo0zo1gwK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l2QlhHlggJEaPdgkfpTt0IA2mHT.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Enforcing the law within the notoriously rough Brownsville section of the city and especially within the Van Dyke housing projects is the NYPD's sixty-fifth precinct. Three police officers struggle with the sometimes fine line between right and wrong.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":889699,\"title\":\"Holy Spider\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6ObJ4x7m1F5QRY06WzOxNJQHwGb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fx6c2UuNnXPwuRvu4tGaJJJITT6.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A journalist descends into the dark underbelly of the Iranian holy city of Mashhad as she investigates the serial killings of sex workers by the so called \\\"Spider Killer\\\", who believes he is cleansing the streets of sinners.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9573,\"title\":\"Blood Work\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A6wWJkIREagRWFNu3YotID3n9aW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6Jatq6wjJ4c2YbPkE5e5VzukEI2.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Still recovering from a heart transplant, a retired FBI profiler returns to service when his own blood analysis offers clues to the identity of a serial killer.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8090,\"title\":\"Untraceable\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ySUwDRDEn01lKIMPQorpFCMLWqE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eIjrpeXSiSq0CN6AE44trDAPRau.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Special Agent Jennifer Marsh works in an elite division of the FBI dedicated to fighting cybercrime. She thinks she has seen it all, until a particularly sadistic criminal arises on the Internet. This tech-savvy killer posts live feeds of his crimes on his website; the more hits the site gets, the faster the victim dies. Marsh and her team must find the elusive killer before time runs out.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":352173,\"title\":\"Drishyam\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gIClWRv5OSe8rl5